Read AGENTS.md before editing. Summary:

GOLDEN RULE: never introduce look-ahead bias; never alter risk math outside src/risk/risk_manager.py.

- Decisions at close t use only data dated <= t; entries fill at open t+1 at the earliest.
- AMC / UNKNOWN earnings react the next session; BMO / DMH the same session.
- All thresholds, fees and risk parameters live in config/settings.yaml + src/config.py.
- Cross-module data uses frozen pydantic v2 models in src/domain/models.py.
- Data sources implement MarketDataProvider; brokers implement ExecutionBroker.
- strategy/ and risk/ are pure (no I/O, no globals).
- Python 3.11+, strict type hints, pytest for every behaviour change; keep tests/test_lookahead.py green.
- Synthetic data must always be labelled synthetic. Never commit .env, venvs, data/cache/, outputs/.
